<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Compatible Games on</title><link>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/games/compatible/</link><description>Recent content in Compatible Games on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/games/compatible/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Asterigos: Curse of the Stars</title><link>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/games/compatible/asterigos-curse-of-the-stars/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/games/compatible/asterigos-curse-of-the-stars/</guid><description>&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="setting-up-automod"&gt;Setting up automod&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#setting-up-automod" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;In &lt;code&gt;.config.json&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;#34;Genesis&amp;#34;: {&#10; &amp;#34;directory&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10; &amp;#34;contentPaks&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;Genesis/Content/Paks&amp;#34;,&#10; &amp;#34;unrealEngine&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;4.27&amp;#34;,&#10; &amp;#34;mapUri&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10; &amp;#34;aesKey&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10; &amp;#34;zen&amp;#34;: true,&#10; &amp;#34;repakPackOptions&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;&#10;}&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;In VSCode User &lt;code&gt;settings.json&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;#34;Genesis.directory&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10;&amp;#34;Genesis.contentPaks&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;Genesis/Content/Paks&amp;#34;,&#10;&amp;#34;Genesis.unrealEngine&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;4.27&amp;#34;,&#10;&amp;#34;Genesis.mapUri&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10;&amp;#34;Genesis.aesKey&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10;&amp;#34;Genesis.zen&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;true&amp;#34;,&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;See the &lt;a href="https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/getting-started/prerequisites/"&gt;Prerequisites&lt;/a&gt; section on how to extract a game AES key.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Fill in the &lt;code&gt;.directory&lt;/code&gt; location; note that &lt;code&gt;.directory&lt;/code&gt; uses the operating system path (&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;drive&amp;gt;:\&amp;lt;path-to-game&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="carefree-mode"&gt;Carefree Mode&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#carefree-mode" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.nexusmods.com/asterigoscurseofthestars/mods/14"&gt;https://www.nexusmods.com/asterigoscurseofthestars/mods/14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Asterix &amp; Obelix XXXL: The Ram From Hibernia</title><link>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/games/compatible/asterix-and-obelix-xxxl-the-ram-from-hibernia/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/games/compatible/asterix-and-obelix-xxxl-the-ram-from-hibernia/</guid><description>&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="setting-up-automod"&gt;Setting up automod&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#setting-up-automod" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;In &lt;code&gt;.config.json&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;#34;AOA&amp;#34;: {&#10; &amp;#34;aesKey&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10; &amp;#34;contentPaks&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;AOA/Content/Paks&amp;#34;,&#10; &amp;#34;directory&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10; &amp;#34;mapUri&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10; &amp;#34;repakPackOptions&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10; &amp;#34;unrealEngine&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;4.27&amp;#34;,&#10; &amp;#34;zen&amp;#34;: false&#10;}&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;In VSCode User &lt;code&gt;settings.json&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&amp;#34;AOA.directory&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10;&amp;#34;AOA.contentPaks&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;AOA/Content/Paks&amp;#34;,&#10;&amp;#34;AOA.unrealEngine&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;4.27&amp;#34;,&#10;&amp;#34;AOA.mapUri&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10;&amp;#34;AOA.aesKey&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10;&amp;#34;AOA.zen&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;false&amp;#34;,&#10;&amp;#34;AOA.repakPackOptions&amp;#34;: &amp;#34;&amp;#34;,&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Fill in the &lt;code&gt;.directory&lt;/code&gt;; note that &lt;code&gt;.directory&lt;/code&gt; uses the operating system path (&lt;code&gt;&amp;lt;drive&amp;gt;:\&amp;lt;path-to-game&amp;gt;&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="combat-hack"&gt;Combat Hack&lt;a class="td-heading-self-link" href="#combat-hack" aria-label="Heading self-link"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/8466/images/1/1-1764102882-1417887287.png" alt="combat-hack"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;"&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&#9;&lt;iframe allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen" loading="eager" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/5bCqER2oWo0?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0" style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;" title="YouTube video"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#10;&#9;&#9;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Burning Sword: Death Sun</title><link>https://jpabscale.github.io/automod/docs/games/compatible/burning-sword-death-sun/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00: